---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/catalog";

const crumbs = [
  { href: href(), label: "地圖" },
  { label: "搜尋" },
];
---

<Base
  title="搜尋"
  description="在 NIST CSF 2.0 的功能、類別與子類別中搜尋 ID、英文成果與繁體中文說明。"
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <article class="page">
    <header class="mast" data-fn="PR">
      <p class="eyebrow">Search</p>
      <h1>搜尋框架</h1>
      <p class="meta">可查 ID、官方英文與非官方中文。按 <kbd>/</kbd> 也能從任何一頁打開搜尋。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="search-panel" data-search data-search-autoload>
      <div class="search-row">
        <input data-search-input type="search" placeholder="例如 ID.AM、供應鏈、least privilege" aria-label="搜尋 CSF 2.0" />
      </div>
      <p data-search-status class="search-status"></p>
      <ul data-search-results class="search-results"></ul>
    </div>
    <noscript>
      <p>搜尋需要 JavaScript。目錄裡的功能與類別不需要 JavaScript 就能瀏覽。</p>
    </noscript>
  </article>
</Base>
